{"id":"0cdd45feac142f0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-laver-condition.md","title":"ZFC Laver Condition","display":"df-zfc-laver-condition — ZFC Laver Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-laver-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-laver-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-laver-condition — ZFC Laver Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-laver-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-laver-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-laver-condition — ZFC Laver Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35129dbe4a036ed2\" href=\"?note=35129dbe4a036ed2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,s\\in V\">\\(T,s\\in V\\)</span> (Laver tree and specified stem candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S\\)</span> (canonical Laver-tree predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaverCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LaverCondition}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}laver\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{LaverCondition}_S(T,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S(T)\\land s\\in T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s\\subseteq t\\to\\bigl|\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\bigr|=\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}laver\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{LaverCondition}_S(T,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S(T)\\land s\\in T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s\\subseteq t\\to\\bigl|\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\bigr|=\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The tree clauses come from the canonical Laver-tree predicate; the remaining conjuncts certify that the supplied <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>, rather than merely some node, is a valid stem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree","status":"resolved","id":"35129dbe4a036ed2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LaverCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}laver\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{LaverCondition}_S(T,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S(T)\\land s\\in T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s\\subseteq t\\to\\bigl|\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\bigr|=\\aleph_0\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false}],"bytes":1019,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-laver-condition.md|58-df-zfc-laver-condition]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["35129dbe4a036ed2"]}